        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is about a computer programmer by day, hacker by night. He embarks on a dystopian adventure, investigating a failing enterprise in a world dominated by mega-corporations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia</strong>, a conspiracy festers in the digital shadows, and you are the rogue hacker high-tech enough to expose it. Dive into a gritty cyberpunk thriller that merges intense first-person shooting with a deep, branching narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven FPS where your decisions matter. Navigate a dynamic world across distinct levels, confronting a large roster of enemies from multiple factions. Every moral choice you make will have an impact, shaping your journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense FPS Combat:</strong> Wield a diverse arsenal of weapons in a rich, narrative-driven campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Moral Choices:</strong> Make difficult decisions that alter the story and your place in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Progression:</strong> Evolve your character's skills and abilities to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Manage:</strong> Scavenge for valuable loot, build new gear, and organize it all in a classic grid-based inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Conspiracy:</strong> Hunt for collectibles and lore-rich documents to piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A City of Enemies:</strong> Navigate a dynamic world filled with distinct levels, multiple factions, and a large roster of deadly foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia: Prologue</strong>, every decision you make in and out of combat feeds into a layered progression and gear system designed for tinkerers, min-maxers, and lore hunters alike. More features will be released in upcoming game updates.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is about a computer programmer by day, hacker by night. He embarks on a dystopian adventure, investigating a failing enterprise in a world dominated by mega-corporations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia</strong>, a conspiracy festers in the digital shadows, and you are the rogue hacker high-tech enough to expose it. Dive into a gritty cyberpunk thriller that merges intense first-person shooting with a deep, branching narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven FPS where your decisions matter. Navigate a dynamic world across distinct levels, confronting a large roster of enemies from multiple factions. Every moral choice you make will have an impact, shaping your journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense FPS Combat:</strong> Wield a diverse arsenal of weapons in a rich, narrative-driven campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Moral Choices:</strong> Make difficult decisions that alter the story and your place in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Progression:</strong> Evolve your character's skills and abilities to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Manage:</strong> Scavenge for valuable loot, build new gear, and organize it all in a classic grid-based inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Conspiracy:</strong> Hunt for collectibles and lore-rich documents to piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A City of Enemies:</strong> Navigate a dynamic world filled with distinct levels, multiple factions, and a large roster of deadly foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia: Prologue</strong>, every decision you make in and out of combat feeds into a layered progression and gear system designed for tinkerers, min-maxers, and lore hunters alike. More features will be released in upcoming game updates.</p>",
